      "select rollback retains caller and channel ownership",
      "select commit linearizes exactly one ready arm",
      "select else returns without changing observable state",
      "simultaneously ready arms rotate fairly",
      "cancellation unregisters a waiter and returns an affine payload",
      "closing the last receiver wakes blocked senders with intact payloads",
      "closing the last receiver drains committed values in FIFO order",
      "closing the last sender ends receive only after the queue drains",
      "each completed waiter receives exactly one wakeup",
      "cleanup leaves no queue, waiter, result or non-caller payload ownership",
      "stale endpoints and waiter tokens fail closed"
    ],
    "sequence_seeds": 4096,
